  "title": "Vertiv unveils new systems to solve speed of deployment, management, and rack power and cooling challenges for AI applications",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions, today announced the global launch of four new systems designed to address challenges driven by the rapid growth of AI applications. Vertiv’s expanded capabilities in infrastructure management, prefabricated modular deployment, advanced thermal management, and DC power distribution provide options for managing the increased power and heat density, complexity, and operational demands of AI.",
